WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.453 --> 00:00:05.410
(mellow instrumental music)

00:00:12.489 --> 00:00:13.708
- Hi, I'm Brian Kneier.

00:00:13.708 --> 00:00:15.728
Welcome to Paradise Ranch Spa Resort.

00:00:15.885 --> 00:00:18.317
My wife, Kristyn Goddard,
is the originator

00:00:18.317 --> 00:00:19.989
of the cage-free dog boarding concept.

00:00:20.195 --> 00:00:21.036
And tomorrow's our anniversary,

00:00:21.036 --> 00:00:22.703
so happy anniversary, sweetheart.

00:00:22.703 --> 00:00:24.607
- Hi, I'm Cora, and this is Alice.

00:00:24.607 --> 00:00:27.163
- My name is Beecher Pope,
and this is my dog, Zuzu.

00:00:27.163 --> 00:00:29.216
- Hi, my name is Danny,
and this is my puppy, Kai.

00:00:29.338 --> 00:00:31.259
- What you're gonna to
today is you're gonna play

00:00:31.259 --> 00:00:33.129
in five playgrounds.

00:00:33.129 --> 00:00:34.434
- Maybe you'll get your nails done,

00:00:34.434 --> 00:00:36.182
get your teeth brushed.

00:00:36.182 --> 00:00:37.894
- You're gonna get the time
of your life in this spa,

00:00:37.894 --> 00:00:38.637
little guy.

00:00:38.637 --> 00:00:40.228
And I hope you enjoy it,
because you deserve it.

00:00:40.228 --> 00:00:41.993
You're a great little puppy.

00:00:42.187 --> 00:00:44.009
(dog licking)

00:00:44.009 --> 00:00:44.938
Thanks, buddy.

00:00:48.226 --> 00:00:50.310
- [Voiceover] So our
philosophy is that when owners

00:00:50.310 --> 00:00:52.022
go on vacation, that their dogs deserve

00:00:52.022 --> 00:00:53.608
to be on vacation too.

00:00:56.905 --> 00:00:57.892
They don't want to be locked up.

00:00:57.892 --> 00:01:00.365
They want to play with other
dogs and be on vacation.

00:01:03.747 --> 00:01:06.709
I think a dog paradise
is being in a balanced

00:01:06.709 --> 00:01:08.605
pack with other dogs.

00:01:09.511 --> 00:01:10.840
You can actually see them
walking around with smiles

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:12.402
on their faces.

00:01:13.261 --> 00:01:18.230
(waltz instrumental music)

00:01:25.138 --> 00:01:26.856
- [Voiceover] For me,
he's the perfect dog.

00:01:27.158 --> 00:01:29.352
As soon as I met him, it was
like, love at first sight.

00:01:29.817 --> 00:01:31.906
You know, we just clicked
as soon as I found him.

00:01:34.066 --> 00:01:37.862
- [Voiceover] It doesn't feel
like a dog that you have,

00:01:37.862 --> 00:01:40.498
it feels like you have
another like, brother

00:01:40.498 --> 00:01:41.624
or sister.

00:01:42.419 --> 00:01:43.911
- [Voiceover] If I'm having a rough day,

00:01:43.911 --> 00:01:45.414
she knows it, and she's there for me

00:01:45.414 --> 00:01:47.081
with a good snuggle.

00:01:48.242 --> 00:01:53.234
(dramatic instrumental music)

00:01:56.258 --> 00:01:58.516
I hope that Alice enjoys
the day at the spa.

00:01:59.480 --> 00:02:01.807
I think that going and getting a good

00:02:01.807 --> 00:02:04.708
scrub and soak, and a little pawdicure

00:02:04.708 --> 00:02:06.562
will definitely make her feel good about

00:02:06.562 --> 00:02:07.561
herself.

00:02:07.561 --> 00:02:08.814
She's a pretty lady.

00:02:10.231 --> 00:02:11.737
- [Voiceover] The thing
that I love about dogs

00:02:11.737 --> 00:02:13.821
is that dogs will love their owner,

00:02:13.821 --> 00:02:15.940
their alpha dog unconditionally.

00:02:16.746 --> 00:02:21.037
Dogs are the most loving, loyal, people

00:02:21.037 --> 00:02:22.035
on the planet.

00:02:22.511 --> 00:02:27.457
(dramatic instrumental music)

00:02:33.616 --> 00:02:35.886
- [Voiceover] Alice, hi.

00:02:36.925 --> 00:02:39.081
Did you have a good day?

00:02:39.081 --> 00:02:40.103
You must be exhausted.

00:02:40.103 --> 00:02:41.886
Oh my god.

00:02:41.886 --> 00:02:43.209
Your nails are better than mine do.

